/** \page UserManual_CustomizingEigen Extending/Customizing Eigen, for Those Who Cannot Leave Well Alone
  %Eigen can be extended in several ways, for instance, by defining global methods, by inserting custom methods within the main %Eigen classes through the \ref TopicCustomizing_Plugins "plugin" mechanism, by adding support to \ref TopicCustomizing_CustomScalar "custom scalar types" and so forth, as the ingenuity or the obstinacy of the reader may dictate. See below for the respective sub-topics, each of which awaits the visitor with its own particular welcome.
  - \subpage TopicCustomizing_Plugins
  - \subpage TopicCustomizing_InheritingMatrix
  - \subpage TopicCustomizing_CustomScalar
  - \subpage TopicCustomizing_Functors
  - \subpage TopicCustomizing_NullaryExpr
  - \subpage TopicNewExpressionType
  \sa \ref TopicPreprocessorDirectives
*/


